.TH sam-jail-preset-apply 1 2026-11-23 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-preset\-apply \- Apply a preset to an app (asks for confirmation when it conflicts)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail preset apply\fR [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-expect\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Apply a preset to an app (asks for confirmation when it conflicts)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-expect\fR \fI<EXPECT>\fR
Apply only if the preset is still the one checked: the `fingerprint` of an earlier `preset apply` reply
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

